                    "source_id": "Index_243",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "He wished them goodbye and they left the hotel.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 1265,
                        "end": 1365
                    },
                    "doc_index": 329,
                    "source_id": "Index_329",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "She carried herself like a lady in contrast to certain vulgar attendees.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 432,
                        "end": 532
                    },
                    "doc_index": 243,
                    "source_id": "Index_243",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "If they catch him, he will still be a martyr.": {
                    "condition": "if they catch him",
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 1848,
                        "end": 1948
                    },
                    "doc_index": 42,
                    "source_id": "Index_42",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "He was at peace with his ideology.": {
                    "time": "a few months ago",
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 2397,
                        "end": 2497
                    },
                    "doc_index": 125,
                    "source_id": "Index_125",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "He started hallucinating.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 3780,
                        "end": 3880
                    },
                    "doc_index": 439,
                    "source_id": "Index_439",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "Don Lorenzo and Zack Cahill were in different places.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 3562,
                        "end": 3653
                    },
                    "doc_index": 85,
                    "source_id": "Index_85",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "He was going to ask her to help them when it clearly hurt her.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 3596,
                        "end": 3696
                    },
                    "doc_index": 352,
                    "source_id": "Index_352",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "He wants us to be friends.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 2405,
                        "end": 2455
                    },
                    "doc_index": 166,
                    "source_id": "Index_166",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "He will let the emperor know that his nephew is happy and healthy the next time he sees him.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 4462,
                        "end": 4562
                    },
                    "doc_index": 329,
                    "source_id": "Index_329",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "It was significant to him that he could make friends within the first week.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 3219,
                        "end": 3319
                    },
                    "doc_index": 341,
                    "source_id": "Index_341",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "He proclaimed Marx the thinker of the future.": {
                    "time": "a few months back",
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 2266,
                        "end": 2366
                    },
                    "doc_index": 125,
                    "source_id": "Index_125",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "She inquired if someone is familiar with the syndrome.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 2592,
                        "end": 2692
                    },
                    "doc_index": 243,
                    "source_id": "Index_243",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "He felt cut off from the world in the sealed and closed chamber.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 3584,
                        "end": 3684
                    },
                    "doc_index": 439,
                    "source_id": "Index_439",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "He was caught in a pinch with cause for suspicion.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 275,
                        "end": 375
                    },
                    "doc_index": 25,
                    "source_id": "Index_25",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "Don Lorenzo states that all men have seven blind spots.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 783,
                        "end": 883
                    },
                    "doc_index": 418,
                    "source_id": "Index_418",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                },
                "He had really bad nightmares.": {
                    "text_span": {
                        "start": 3850,
                        "end": 3891
                    },
                    "doc_index": 439,
                    "source_id": "Index_439",
                    "source_domain": "Unknown"
                }
            }
